    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15350" root="رز" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَزَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single piercing; a stick,</i> or <i>stab.</i> (S,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A pain in the back.</i> (Sgh, TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  The <i>iron</i> [meaning the <i>staple</i>] <i>into which</i>
[<i>the bolt of</i>] <i>the lock enters:</i> (S, K:) so called
because [the bolt of] the lock penetrates it: pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَزَّاتٌ</span>. (TA.)

